                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reply From British Ambassador</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honour to refer to your Note of
                    this day’s date Proposing an Agreement between the Government of the United
                    Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland and the Government <pb facs="0126"
                        n="118" xml:id="pg118"/> of the United States of America on the subject of
                    Canton and Enderbury Islands in the terms of the following Articles:—</p>
                <p>[Here follows text of articles set forth in draft note from the United States
                    Government printed <hi rendition="#italic">supra.</hi>]</p>
            </div>
